; ============================================================================
; CE4 clipped 2x2 and immutable Stage-3 panel charge shortcuts.
;
; hce4_entry has already validated the caller frame, mapped/bounded the source,
; consumed the two header words, and retained the original X/Y/capacity in
; $88/$8A/$92.  The later renderer fast path accepts exactly this same class:
; header 1,1; capacity three; and four nonzero source words.  The bank-$9F:D300
; helper derives the exact original instruction count from both signed X-row
; clip branches and both signed Y-column clip branches.
;
; The exact Stage-3 panel tuple has a constant 333-instruction post-LINK path.
; Any guard miss jumps to bank-$94's original exact bounded source walk before
; changing $AC.  The fixed targets and complete island are packer-audited.
; ============================================================================
