; ============================================================================
; Remaining bank-$01 BSR scan for the three Stage-3 player-hot bodies.
;
; The packed bank-$92 scan cannot grow past $F600.  It reaches this extension
; before the ordinary interpreter has pushed the 68000 BSR return.  On a hit,
; materialize that genuine return exactly, discard bsr_hookpush's 65816
; return, and enter the table/rts body.  A miss rejoins bank-$92 jxb_real
; without changing the native stack.
; ============================================================================
    .org $FD00
.a16
.i16
